WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
Where do your AI coding hours go? Your prompts are scattered across five assistants.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.500
Claude Code, Copilot, Cursor, Antigravity and opencode converge into one local view.

00:09.500 --> 00:14.500
Sessions, prompts, tokens and estimated cost count up, with deltas.

00:14.500 --> 00:21.000
A calendar heatmap of 164 active days ripples out, with spend by tool.

00:21.000 --> 00:27.000
A funnel shows where prompts stall, and friction rates show corrections and retries.

00:27.000 --> 00:33.000
Secrets and PII are found and masked. Redacted before anything is stored.

00:33.000 --> 00:38.000
Click any bar or cluster to drill into the prompts behind it.

00:38.000 --> 00:42.000
Know where your hours go. Run uvx prompt-analytics run.
